    "description": "<p>For every 50 credits spent, the Droid can carry 1 kg of material or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a> in Compartment Space. A Droid's size determines the maximum weight of items stored in Compartment Space, as noted below:</p><table class=\"wikitable\">\n <tbody>\n  <tr>\n   <th>DROID SIZE</th>\n   <th></th>\n   <th>MAXIMUM WEIGHT LIMIT</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td>Small</td>\n   <td></td>\n   <td>5 kg</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td>Medium</td>\n   <td></td>\n   <td>10 kg</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td>Large</td>\n   <td></td>\n   <td>20 kg</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td>Huge</td>\n   <td></td>\n   <td>50 kg</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td>Gargantuan</td>\n   <td></td>\n   <td>500 kg</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n   <td>Colossal</td>\n   <td></td>\n   <td>5,000 kg</td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table>",
